LG, webOS, YouTube, Plex, Alexa, AirPlay and other names identify compatible
products or functions; no affiliation or endorsement is implied.

Landscape image files are not tracked. The downloader retrieves US Fish &
Wildlife Service source variants whose individual pages label them Public
Domain. Exact sources and integrity hashes are in assets/landscapes.json.
The site credits include USFWS, Steve Hillebrand/USFWS and Scott Rheam/USFWS;
consult each source page for the complete attribution. The app displays the
collection credit, and this repository makes no ownership claim over photos.

No LG logos, firmware payloads, original LG manifests or upstream exploit
scripts are included. Public app overlays are purpose-written inert pages.
The Home-key API approach was investigated using the TV's native key filter
interface and the Glasshouse remote-key implementation as a reference:
https://github.com/rorygallagher2024/glasshouse/blob/6ffc51445095ac0cbc891291ac399c93a8e82c45/server/lib/remotekeys.js
The small filter in this repository is independently written.

The package icon is generated from original geometric drawing code.
